- Before drafting or editing any blog article body, `title`, or `description`, read and follow `playbooks/writing-voice.md` in full.
- For revenue reports, also follow `playbooks/revenue-report.md`. **Voice rules in writing-voice.md take priority over tone tips elsewhere.**
- Do not ship copy that fails the checklist in `playbooks/writing-voice.md` §6.
- Prefer concrete numbers and unfinished questions over generic “実践・改善・収益化” prose.
